{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":19,"code":"PSA","name":"Psalms","testament":"OT"},"chapter":50,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"d","content":["A Psalm of Asaph. "]},{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"PSA 50:1"},"The mighty God, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["even"]}," the LORD, hath spoken, and called the earth from the rising of the sun unto the going down thereof. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 50:1"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"PSA 50:2"},"Out of Zion, the perfection of beauty, God hath shined. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 50:2"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"PSA 50:3"},"Our God shall come, and shall not keep silence: a fire shall devour before him, and it shall be very tempestuous round about him. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 50:3"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"PSA 50:4"},"He shall call to the heavens from above, and to the earth, that he may judge his people. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 50:4"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"PSA 50:5"},"Gather my saints together unto me; those that have made a covenant with me by sacrifice. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 50:5"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"PSA 50:6"},"And the heavens shall declare his righteousness: for God ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is "]},"judge himself. Selah. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 50:6"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"7","sid":"PSA 50:7"},"Hear, O my people, and I will speak; O Israel, and I will testify against thee: I ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["am"]}," God, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["even"]}," thy God. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 50:7"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"8","sid":"PSA 50:8"},"I will not reprove thee for thy sacrifices or thy burnt offerings, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["to have been"]}," continually before me. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 50:8"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"9","sid":"PSA 50:9"},"I will take no bullock out of thy house, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["nor"]}," he goats out of thy folds. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 50:9"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"10","sid":"PSA 50:10"},"For every beast of the forest ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," mine, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," the cattle upon a thousand hills. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 50:10"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"11","sid":"PSA 50:11"},"I know all the fowls of the mountains: and the wild beasts of the field ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," mine. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 50:11"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"12","sid":"PSA 50:12"},"If I were hungry, I would not tell thee: for the world ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is "]},"mine, and the fulness thereof. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 50:12"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"13","sid":"PSA 50:13"},"Will I eat the flesh of bulls, or drink the blood of goats? ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 50:13"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"14","sid":"PSA 50:14"},"Offer unto God thanksgiving; and pay thy vows unto the most High: ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 50:14"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"15","sid":"PSA 50:15"},"And call upon me in the day of trouble: I will deliver thee, and thou shalt glorify me. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 50:15"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"16","sid":"PSA 50:16"},"But unto the wicked God saith, What hast thou to do to declare my statutes, or ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["that"]}," thou shouldest take my covenant in thy mouth? ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 50:16"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"17","sid":"PSA 50:17"},"Seeing thou hatest instruction, and castest my words behind thee. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 50:17"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"18","sid":"PSA 50:18"},"When thou sawest a thief, then thou consentedst with him, and hast been partaker with adulterers. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 50:18"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"19","sid":"PSA 50:19"},"Thou givest thy mouth to evil, and thy tongue frameth deceit. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 50:19"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"20","sid":"PSA 50:20"},"Thou sittest ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," speakest against thy brother; thou slanderest thine own mother’s son. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 50:20"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"21","sid":"PSA 50:21"},"These ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["things"]}," hast thou done, and I kept silence; thou thoughtest that I was altogether ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["such an one"]}," as thyself: ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["but "]},"I will reprove thee, and set ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["them"]}," in order before thine eyes. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 50:21"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"22","sid":"PSA 50:22"},"Now consider this, ye that forget God, lest I tear ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["you"]}," in pieces, and ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["there be"]}," none to deliver. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 50:22"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"23","sid":"PSA 50:23"},"Whoso offereth praise glorifieth me: and to him that ordereth ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["his"]}," conversation ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["aright"]}," will I shew the salvation of God. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 50:23"}]}]}
